---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/main.astro';
import { baseUrl } from '../lib/base-url';
---

<MainLayout>
<div class="min-h-screen bg-background">
<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
<!-- Card principale -->
<div class="card-rounded border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm" style="padding: 1rem 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem;">
<!-- Titolo principale -->
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; text-align: center;">
<h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-heading" style="word-break: break-word;">
Area Genitori
</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
Scuola di Ciclismo - Portale Genitori
</p>
</div>

<!-- Separatore -->
<div style="height: 1px; background-color: var(--border);"></div>

<!-- SEZIONE: Benvenuto -->
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
<div style="width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--primary); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary-foreground)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
<path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
<circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
</svg>
</div>
<h4 class="font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider" style="font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0;">
Benvenuto
</h4>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
Questo portale ti permette di gestire in modo semplice e veloce 
i tuoi dati personali e, in futuro, le iscrizioni dei tuoi bambini 
ai corsi di ciclismo.
</p>
</div>

<!-- Separatore -->
<div style="height: 1px; background-color: var(--border);"></div>

<!-- SEZIONE: Cosa puoi fare -->
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
<div style="width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--primary); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary-foreground)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
<polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
</svg>
</div>
<h4 class="font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider" style="font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0;">
Cosa puoi fare
</h4>
</div>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
<span style="color: var(--primary);">✓</span> Registrati come genitore
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
<span style="color: var(--primary);">✓</span> Accedi alla tua area personale
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
<span style="color: var(--primary);">✓</span> Visualizza e modifica i tuoi dati
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.6;">
<span>•</span> Gestione iscrizioni (prossimamente)
</li>
</ul>
</div>

<!-- Separatore -->
<div style="height: 1px; background-color: var(--border);"></div>

<!-- CTA Buttons -->
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
<a href={`${baseUrl}/registrazione`} class="pulsante1 btn-standard block text-center flex items-center justify-center">
Registrati
</a>
<a href={`${baseUrl}/login`} class="pulsante1 is-secondary btn-standard block text-center flex items-center justify-center">
Accedi
</a>
</div>

<!-- Separatore -->
<div style="height: 1px; background-color: var(--border);"></div>

<!-- Info box -->
<div class="card-rounded bg-muted/50" style="padding: 1rem 1.5rem;">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
<div style="width: 2rem; height: 2rem; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--muted-foreground); opacity: 0.3; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
<line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
<line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
</svg>
</div>
<p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground" style="margin: 0;">
Fase 1: Gestione dati anagrafici genitori
</p>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground" style="padding-left: 2.75rem; margin: 0;">
Nelle prossime versioni aggiungeremo la gestione dei bambini e delle iscrizioni ai corsi
</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</MainLayout>
